<title>UK: Lufthansa buys additional Airbus A340.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa buys additional Airbus A340.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>German airline Lufthansa has signed a contract with Airbus Industrie for one additional A340, bringing to 18 its total order for the ultra long-range airliner, Airbus Industrie said in a statement.</p>
<p>The A340-300, to be delivered during the first half of 1998, will be configured to seat 260 passengers.</p>
<p>With a total of 135 Airbus Industrie aircraft ordered, Lufthansa is the largest single airline customer of the European consortium.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
